{"created": "2026-07-23T14:44:55.317954+00:00", "modified": "2026-07-23T14:44:59.289302+00:00", "id": 21512082, "conceptrecid": "20410947", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21512082", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.20410947", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21512082", "metadata": {"title": "SGA 1-6: Compact English Working Readers, Reference-Linked Editions, and Audit Archives", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21512082", "publication_date": "2026-07-23", "description": "<p>This same-concept compact successor consolidates the current SGA 3 English progress through complete Expose IV into one 266-page cumulative reader, primary editable master, and 200-member source/reference/QA ZIP. The previously split I-III and IV files remain immutable in predecessor version 10.5281/zenodo.21511144; all unrelated SGA files are retained byte-identically.</p>\n<p>The cumulative reader covers the Editorial Notice, Introduction, and complete Exposes I-IV. It has 1,519 named destinations and 1,062 linked internal rectangles. Its machine-readable graph records 411 targets, 1,157 candidate occurrences, 611 linked edges, and one disposition for every candidate.</p>\n<p>Expose IV uses native TeX diagrams. The cumulative source archive retains 130 PNG diagram assets inherited from the already public I-III working reader: 96 are build dependencies and 34 are recovery or QA assets. Every PNG is byte-identical to a member of the predecessor I-III source archive, so this successor introduces no new source-pixel class.</p>\n<p>The standalone 51-page Expose V Loop-2 native-diagram/reference-v2 working reader remains unchanged. SGA 3 is not complete: Exposes VI-XXVI are not included. SGA 2 R8 remains the default preview. SGA 1 remains a complete-scope working reader without exhaustive convention-v2 certification; SGA 4 proper r7, SGA 5 R9, and the complete layered terminal SGA 6 reader remain unchanged.</p>\n<p>SGA 3 uses current Polo-Gille PDFs as controlling witnesses; OCR is locator material only. Jacob C. Reinhold's jcreinhold/sga snapshot e7a259f3f8608ad3edf9bf6eead3fd504dd2d23e is credited comparison and drafting lineage, not authority. Reinhold states that his translation contribution is CC BY 4.0; that statement does not license the underlying French work, source-derived visual witnesses, or unrelated contributions.</p>\n<p>No new license grant is asserted; rights remain with their respective holders. Machine-assisted contributors include OpenAI Codex / ChatGPT and Anthropic Claude under human direction. These are modern working editions and translations, not critical editions, mathematical certifications, independent human peer review, blanket rights determinations, or accessibility certifications. This successor updates only existing SGA concept 10.5281/zenodo.20410947.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Manuscript Typesetting Project", "affiliation": "Independent"}], "contributors": [{"name": "OpenAI Codex / ChatGPT", "affiliation": "OpenAI", "type": "Other"}, {"name": "Anthropic Claude", "affiliation": "Anthropic", "type": "Other"}], "keywords": ["SGA", "Grothendieck", "algebraic geometry", "LaTeX", "translation", "source audit", "source synchronization", "source rescribe", "working edition", "not critical edition", "SGA1", "SGA5", "SGA6", "English translation", "French source workpass", "Spanish translation", "machine-assisted translation", "SGA3", "SGA4", "bounded working reader", "public progress", "reference-linked reader", "reference-v2", "complete translation scope", "machine-readable references"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.20393488", "relation": "isPartOf", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "https://github.com/KokunoYumeto/modern-latex-manuscripts", "relation": "isSupplementedBy", "scheme": "url"}], "version": "2026-07-23 SGA3 cumulative through Expose IV Loop2/reference-v2 successor", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "notspecified"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 161, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "20410947"}}]}, "notes": "<p>Reader-first compact surface: direct cumulative PDFs and primary TeX; recursive sources, ledgers, QA, bounded checkpoints, and predecessor maps in coherent ZIPs. SGA3 is cumulative through complete Expose IV plus standalone complete Expose V, while Exposes VI-XXVI remain absent. Immutable predecessors preserve every earlier top-level file.</p>"}, "title": "SGA 1-6: Compact English Working Readers, Reference-Linked Editions, and Audit Archives", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21512082", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21512082", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21512082?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21512082", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21512082", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.21512082", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21512082/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/20410947", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/20410947", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20410947", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.20410947", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21512082/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21512082/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21512082/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21512082/media-files", "thumbnails": {"10": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21512082:00a_SGA1_English_CompleteVolume_Working_NoExhaustiveCertification_20260722.pdf/full/%5E10,/0/default.jpg", "50": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21512082:00a_SGA1_English_CompleteVolume_Working_NoExhaustiveCertification_20260722.pdf/full/%5E50,/0/default.jpg", "100": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21512082:00a_SGA1_English_CompleteVolume_Working_NoExhaustiveCertification_20260722.pdf/full/%5E100,/0/default.jpg", "250":